dim]An underline drawn inside a highlight renders as bold emphasis [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]inside that highlight's quote in Obsidian, bob ref show, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Bob Mac Capture preview. Its comment, tasks, and image notes join [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the highlight, anchors stay valid, and nothing is written to the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]PDF or the sidecar.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]underline_emphasis.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/underline_emphasis.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-9u[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-9u/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Classify, match, and fold underlines into their highlights[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fold-render[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-render: add underline.rs (classifier, match key, host predicate, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]word-snapped runs), plan underlines before continuations in one shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold plan, render runs, comments, image notes, and task links into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]host block, absorb underline IDs with link-aware Merged emphasis stubs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]heal standalone underlines, and rehearse the rollout on a scratch copy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of the affected notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Scan counters, terminal bold, docs, and the Obsidian snippet[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visibility-docs[dim] · [dim